# M5Stack StickS3: the first board of the project. sdkconfig.defaults
# has its settings, and a build without a board file is a build for it.
# A board file comes after sdkconfig.defaults and changes what differs:
# idf.py -DSDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;boards/<name>.defaults" build
CONFIG_HWPASS_BOARD_STICKS3=y
